-- Lean: the formats the lab's profiles add to Dumpstarr's.
--
-- The HEVC formats are Dictionarry's (Dictionarry-Hub/database, MIT): every
-- format its 1080p Efficient profile scores at or above its lowest-scored HEVC
-- format, with their conditions and patterns, copied under names starting with
-- "Lean ". This file is generated, and rewritten when Dictionarry's lists change.


